    <briefdescription>
<para>Plain-text evaluator using normalised character-level edit distance. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>RS = 1 − edit_distance(original, recovered) / max(len(original), len(recovered))</para>
<para>Uses the standard Levenshtein distance. Efficient for documents up to ~100 KB; larger inputs should use the XML or JSON domain evaluators. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
